WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.840 --> 00:00:05.040
(all exclaiming)

00:00:05.500 --> 00:00:06.000
Oh no!

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:07.540
I'm sorry Wren!

00:00:08.140 --> 00:00:09.620
I'm so sorry Wren!

00:00:10.340 --> 00:00:11.760
So today we're gonna play "Archery Golf".

00:00:11.840 --> 00:00:13.160
It's like frisbee golf exept

00:00:13.200 --> 00:00:15.200
instead of there being a basket or a pole

00:00:15.200 --> 00:00:16.440
that you have to hit with a frisbee,

00:00:16.440 --> 00:00:17.020
It's a person

00:00:17.020 --> 00:00:18.060
that you have to hit with an arrow!

00:00:18.140 --> 00:00:19.800
Now, whoever has to take the most shots to hit that person

00:00:19.900 --> 00:00:21.640
becomes the flag pole for the next round.

00:00:22.040 --> 00:00:23.440
You will get hit with an arrow.

00:00:23.600 --> 00:00:25.220
Wren, you remeber when I said I needed you to be

00:00:25.220 --> 00:00:26.660
an integral part of this video?

00:00:29.700 --> 00:00:30.380
Of course...

00:00:30.700 --> 00:00:32.320
Oh, that's what you meant!

00:00:32.460 --> 00:00:35.180
I need you to put on the Waldo shirt and be the first target.

00:00:35.460 --> 00:00:36.360
So let me get this straight...

00:00:36.360 --> 00:00:38.360
You're all gonna take turns shooting an arrow at me?

00:00:38.660 --> 00:00:39.160
Yes.

00:00:39.740 --> 00:00:41.460
Whoever takes the most shots to get to you

00:00:41.460 --> 00:00:42.360
becomes the target for the second round.

00:00:42.500 --> 00:00:44.040
Oh man I hope Jake does poorly.

00:00:44.820 --> 00:00:46.680
Too bad I'm super good at archery!

00:00:47.040 --> 00:00:47.540
Go down there

00:00:48.140 --> 00:00:48.720
Bye Wren!

00:00:48.720 --> 00:00:49.220
Bye Obey!

00:00:50.440 --> 00:00:51.820
Uh, how do you wanna determine who goes first?

00:00:51.820 --> 00:00:52.320
Chin-Chin!

00:00:52.780 --> 00:00:54.220
Niko, let us begin Chin-Chin.

00:00:54.460 --> 00:00:55.600
Chin-Chin two!

00:00:55.600 --> 00:00:56.540
Chin-Chin none!

00:00:56.540 --> 00:00:57.560
Chin-Chin three!

00:00:57.940 --> 00:00:58.440
Fuck!

00:00:58.440 --> 00:00:58.940
Yes!

00:00:59.080 --> 00:00:59.800
Whoo!

00:01:00.180 --> 00:01:00.780
Here you go Jake

00:01:01.060 --> 00:01:01.560
Alright

00:01:01.840 --> 00:01:03.280
There's a little kid out there though so...

00:01:03.340 --> 00:01:04.220
He'll be fine

00:01:06.560 --> 00:01:09.400
I'm not even gonna put the mask on for this cause they're so far away

00:01:12.680 --> 00:01:13.960
Didn't even make it halfway...

00:01:14.520 --> 00:01:15.720
That was disappointing...

00:01:21.080 --> 00:01:22.680
Now we got Niko firing it

00:01:26.640 --> 00:01:28.400
Woah, that did pretty good

00:01:28.980 --> 00:01:29.620
Thank you

00:01:29.620 --> 00:01:30.120
That was pretty good!

00:01:31.760 --> 00:01:33.280
I wonder if they know that they have to shoot the arrow

00:01:33.340 --> 00:01:35.980
at a 45° angle to maximize the distance

00:01:36.440 --> 00:01:37.260
That's physics.

00:01:44.060 --> 00:01:45.600
That was weaksauce

00:01:46.700 --> 00:01:49.880
Brett, you are away so please, begin!

00:01:51.760 --> 00:01:53.260
I hope they don't hit Obey

00:01:53.260 --> 00:01:54.920
my wife would not be happy

00:01:58.560 --> 00:01:59.300
He missed

00:01:59.300 --> 00:02:01.040
but he actually came pretty close!

00:02:01.040 --> 00:02:03.040
The striped shirt kinda threw me off a little bit

00:02:17.320 --> 00:02:18.280
Nice shot!

00:02:18.600 --> 00:02:20.340
Blows the birdie opportunity!

00:02:20.380 --> 00:02:21.420
Can I, can I just knock it in real quick?

00:02:21.860 --> 00:02:23.400
Yeah, go ahead go ahead

00:02:24.280 --> 00:02:25.780
(laughs)

00:02:30.600 --> 00:02:31.100
Yes

00:02:31.360 --> 00:02:33.500
Nine iron huh? Well, you're fired

00:02:33.580 --> 00:02:34.540
This is for par baby!

00:02:36.660 --> 00:02:37.160
Aagghh

00:02:38.900 --> 00:02:39.400
Whooo!

00:02:43.620 --> 00:02:44.920
Alright! Everyone is on par!

00:02:45.040 --> 00:02:46.000
I think we tied

00:02:46.180 --> 00:02:48.000
Yeah that's a Chin-Chin game

00:02:48.000 --> 00:02:49.360
Alright it's a Chin-Chin game to see

00:02:49.360 --> 00:02:50.360
who, uh

00:02:50.880 --> 00:02:52.620
Is the unfortunate victim

00:02:52.860 --> 00:02:53.960
Here's how the game of Chin-Chin works

00:02:53.960 --> 00:02:55.960
If you watch this now you must play Chin-Chin for life

00:02:56.180 --> 00:02:57.760
Just like in rock-paper-scissors where there's a rhythm

00:02:57.760 --> 00:02:59.220
where you go: "one, two, three, shoot!"

00:02:59.220 --> 00:03:00.240
It's the same for Chin-Chin

00:03:00.240 --> 00:03:01.400
"Chin-Chin-blank"

00:03:01.400 --> 00:03:03.320
On that beat you say a number

00:03:03.320 --> 00:03:04.840
I'm gonna go with: "Chin-Chin three!"

00:03:04.840 --> 00:03:07.120
And everyone gets to decide to put up either thumbs,

00:03:07.120 --> 00:03:07.620
both thumbs,

00:03:07.620 --> 00:03:08.300
or no thumbs.

00:03:08.300 --> 00:03:10.300
And if I say a number that is equal to the number

00:03:10.300 --> 00:03:11.500
of thumbs that popped up,

00:03:11.500 --> 00:03:12.440
I lose one hand!

00:03:12.580 --> 00:03:14.440
And the first one to lose both hands wins

00:03:14.460 --> 00:03:15.880
So you keep going until there's one loser

00:03:15.880 --> 00:03:17.100
Chin-Chin six!

00:03:17.960 --> 00:03:18.920
Chin-Chin two

00:03:21.360 --> 00:03:22.400
Chin-Chin two!

00:03:23.120 --> 00:03:24.400
Alright Chin-Chin two!

00:03:25.140 --> 00:03:26.040
Chin-Chin three!

00:03:26.760 --> 00:03:27.660
Chin-Chin none!

00:03:29.520 --> 00:03:30.480
Chin-Chin one

00:03:30.480 --> 00:03:31.300
Chin-Chin none!

00:03:32.860 --> 00:03:33.900
Chin-Chin two!

00:03:34.060 --> 00:03:35.000
Chin-Chin one!

00:03:35.080 --> 00:03:36.000
Chin-Chin two!

00:03:36.420 --> 00:03:37.280
Chin-Chin one!

00:03:40.000 --> 00:03:40.500
Whoo!

00:03:40.900 --> 00:03:41.600
Alright...

00:03:43.140 --> 00:03:43.940
What does "par" mean?

00:03:44.480 --> 00:03:48.000
A par is how many shots it should take you to get into the target/hole

00:03:48.000 --> 00:03:50.580
It should take a competent archer four shots to get to Brett

00:03:50.620 --> 00:03:51.120
and hit him.

00:03:51.380 --> 00:03:52.180
I'm not gonna lose this game

00:03:53.520 --> 00:03:55.400
Right through that hole in the trees

00:03:55.740 --> 00:03:57.220
Oh, bold strategy!

00:03:57.660 --> 00:03:59.660
And it looks like it's payed off!

00:04:00.080 --> 00:04:02.300
He's almost there in a birdie, my god

00:04:04.700 --> 00:04:05.880
Oh, no!

00:04:06.140 --> 00:04:07.180
That's like when you're trying to

00:04:07.180 --> 00:04:09.180
go between the sand trap and the pond

00:04:09.180 --> 00:04:10.100
then you hit the sand trap

00:04:10.500 --> 00:04:11.000
Alright Wren

00:04:11.900 --> 00:04:12.560
Is your go-pro rolling?

00:04:13.100 --> 00:04:13.600
Woah, woah

00:04:13.880 --> 00:04:14.620
Was everything rolling?

00:04:14.620 --> 00:04:15.220
Awww...

00:04:15.220 --> 00:04:16.240
Ooh that's in the pond!

00:04:16.760 --> 00:04:18.180
That's in the pond baby!

00:04:18.180 --> 00:04:19.080
I hadn't fired the arrow yet!

00:04:19.440 --> 00:04:20.640
You just fired it!

00:04:21.920 --> 00:04:23.920
Wren CLEARLY hit the pond

00:04:23.920 --> 00:04:25.660
Wren you're gonna have to take a drop buddy

00:04:26.300 --> 00:04:28.040
Put it behind you and then drop it

00:04:28.040 --> 00:04:29.700
then wherever it lands is where you shoot from

00:04:31.460 --> 00:04:32.760
Alright, further back it is!

00:04:32.760 --> 00:04:34.760
Further back! (laughs)

00:04:40.940 --> 00:04:42.440
I might be able to shoot it out of the tree...

00:04:42.440 --> 00:04:43.620
I think I can do it!

00:04:43.620 --> 00:04:44.860
Hold on. Real quick, real quick

00:04:44.860 --> 00:04:45.360
Ready?

00:04:47.760 --> 00:04:49.260
NOOO!

00:04:49.260 --> 00:04:51.260
I told you we were gonna lose another one!

00:04:52.260 --> 00:04:54.040
You're gonna have to bear-hug it all the way up

00:04:58.840 --> 00:04:59.960
This is a bad idea

00:05:06.920 --> 00:05:07.480
Yeah...

00:05:07.940 --> 00:05:10.420
Brett is just standing out in the field waiting for us to shoot at him

00:05:11.500 --> 00:05:13.000
You've lost two precious irons

00:05:13.140 --> 00:05:14.260
To the tree of death!

00:05:14.280 --> 00:05:15.240
Let us move on!

00:05:15.440 --> 00:05:16.320
Ready Brett?

00:05:18.380 --> 00:05:19.860
Oh! Aww

00:05:20.700 --> 00:05:21.620
(laughs)

00:05:22.320 --> 00:05:23.940
This is what a good shot looks like

00:05:24.040 --> 00:05:24.860
Sorry Brett

00:05:27.180 --> 00:05:29.040
Oh that was a par!!!

00:05:29.040 --> 00:05:30.480
Wren, you're away, sir

00:05:33.160 --> 00:05:34.960
Oh, triple bogie!

00:05:34.960 --> 00:05:36.320
Triple bogie

00:05:36.320 --> 00:05:38.320
"Wren Whiteman, for triple bogie"

00:05:42.460 --> 00:05:43.500
OHH

00:05:43.720 --> 00:05:45.400
Wren is tilting right now

00:05:47.480 --> 00:05:47.980
Wooo

00:05:48.400 --> 00:05:49.520
Oh he hit him, he hit him

00:05:49.800 --> 00:05:50.600
that counts

00:05:50.700 --> 00:05:51.260
Barely!

00:05:51.320 --> 00:05:52.200
We're all sportsmen here

00:05:52.200 --> 00:05:54.320
what do we do when somebody hits the target?

00:05:56.540 --> 00:05:57.180
Well Wren

00:05:57.180 --> 00:05:58.460
Unfortunately for you

00:05:58.460 --> 00:06:00.460
and fortunately for me, Niko and Brett

00:06:00.760 --> 00:06:02.760
You're now the flagpole again

00:06:03.080 --> 00:06:03.880
fantastic...

00:06:04.780 --> 00:06:05.820
So we're gonna raise the stakes a little bit

00:06:05.820 --> 00:06:07.420
the flagpole will be on the other side of the water

00:06:07.420 --> 00:06:08.860
I have a feeling both Brett and Jake are gonna

00:06:08.860 --> 00:06:10.020
put and arrow into the water

00:06:10.340 --> 00:06:11.300
What's up Jake?

00:06:11.300 --> 00:06:13.300
How about we do a tactical skill shot

00:06:13.300 --> 00:06:15.040
where you have to shoot it to the edge

00:06:15.040 --> 00:06:16.000
and then shoot across

00:06:16.240 --> 00:06:17.720
No we're gonna lose our arrows, guaranteed

00:06:17.720 --> 00:06:18.640
Come on dude...

00:06:18.640 --> 00:06:21.360
None of you guys have the control to not overshoot

00:06:21.360 --> 00:06:22.280
I'll bet you!

00:06:22.320 --> 00:06:23.180
I'll bet you ten dollars!

00:06:23.360 --> 00:06:24.320
I won't overshoot it

00:06:24.320 --> 00:06:26.900
Um, I just saw you overshoot it five minutes ago

00:06:26.900 --> 00:06:28.480
Yeah, I know. But I be you on this one I won't

00:06:28.480 --> 00:06:29.200
I bet you ten dollars.

00:06:30.800 --> 00:06:31.420
Ten dollars?

00:06:35.780 --> 00:06:37.140
This is like the handshake between

00:06:37.140 --> 00:06:38.900
Trudeau and Donald Trump

00:06:39.180 --> 00:06:39.680
Wait a minute...

00:06:39.680 --> 00:06:40.420
Oh you mean like this?

00:06:40.420 --> 00:06:41.600
Yeah, yeah like (struggles)

00:06:42.120 --> 00:06:43.600
Haha like, what was that?

00:06:44.400 --> 00:06:45.600
We're gonna start back there...

00:06:45.600 --> 00:06:46.560
wait for him to get to the edge here

00:06:46.560 --> 00:06:48.000
and then shoot over the water.

00:06:48.000 --> 00:06:50.700
SKILL is the name of this game

00:06:50.700 --> 00:06:52.260
And I'm gonna make ten bucks in the process

00:06:52.260 --> 00:06:53.100
What's the par?

00:06:53.620 --> 00:06:54.180
Par...

00:06:54.180 --> 00:06:54.680
Three?

00:06:54.900 --> 00:06:55.420
Par three

00:06:55.720 --> 00:06:57.000
Confidence level is high...

00:06:57.000 --> 00:07:00.100
I plan on just taking a little bit of Niko's pride with this one

00:07:00.100 --> 00:07:01.700
I could maybe aim for one of those trees

00:07:01.700 --> 00:07:03.420
just hit the tree and it'll stop it right there

00:07:03.420 --> 00:07:05.080
but if I miss the tree it goes right into the water.

00:07:05.080 --> 00:07:06.160
Or I could shoot it up

00:07:06.160 --> 00:07:08.100
so it comes back down with no forward momentum

00:07:08.100 --> 00:07:09.480
and then hits the ground in front

00:07:09.900 --> 00:07:11.520
More than anything else I don't want it to go into the water

00:07:11.620 --> 00:07:13.480
So that Jake can't gloat

00:07:20.200 --> 00:07:21.320
He takes no risks

00:07:21.460 --> 00:07:22.960
Niko "safety"  Pueringer

00:07:23.160 --> 00:07:25.160
This arrow here is worth ten dollars to Niko

00:07:25.500 --> 00:07:27.500
My pride is worth ten dollars

00:07:28.360 --> 00:07:29.440
All about to change...

00:07:34.040 --> 00:07:36.040
(all exclaiming)

00:07:40.260 --> 00:07:40.920
It's right here!

00:07:40.920 --> 00:07:41.500
We're safe!

00:07:41.780 --> 00:07:42.720
Good show, good show

00:07:48.500 --> 00:07:49.440
Niko are you gonna go over?

00:07:49.640 --> 00:07:51.180
Yes, yes I will be

00:07:51.180 --> 00:07:52.380
Don't lose it in the water!

00:07:52.720 --> 00:07:53.440
No chance

00:07:53.780 --> 00:07:54.320
Ready?

00:07:56.660 --> 00:07:57.700
It's in the water!

00:07:58.420 --> 00:08:00.700
Oh... More over! Wow...

00:08:00.800 --> 00:08:03.760
That added way more clearance than I thought I needed

00:08:11.340 --> 00:08:12.220
Well Niko...

00:08:12.280 --> 00:08:13.380
You've earned ten dollars, Jake

00:08:13.660 --> 00:08:14.620
Where is it?

00:08:14.740 --> 00:08:16.000
Oh I don't have any cash on me

00:08:17.560 --> 00:08:18.520
I'll Venmo him ten dollars

00:08:18.520 --> 00:08:19.400
You better Venmo me...

00:08:19.440 --> 00:08:21.540
Full draw, full draw, full draw there you go!

00:08:22.600 --> 00:08:24.240
Whoo, clips the tree on the way over!

00:08:24.860 --> 00:08:26.540
Oh, you guys are so close!

00:08:27.320 --> 00:08:28.140
That was great

00:08:34.260 --> 00:08:36.720
Fortunately, I made it across the pond

00:08:36.720 --> 00:08:38.600
but, I'm right in front of this tree.

00:08:38.600 --> 00:08:42.480
Do I shoot over the next branch and under the one after that?

00:08:42.480 --> 00:08:45.040
Or do I attempt to go over this one, and over that one

00:08:45.040 --> 00:08:46.560
and then under the white tree?

00:08:46.600 --> 00:08:48.200
I would go over this and then under this...

00:08:49.720 --> 00:08:51.360
Well Niko, that's where you and I are different

00:08:51.360 --> 00:08:52.300
Cause I'm gonna go over both

00:08:55.040 --> 00:08:55.540
Ready?

00:08:58.320 --> 00:08:59.620
Oooh, very close

00:08:59.860 --> 00:09:00.420
Whoo!

00:09:01.340 --> 00:09:03.560
I still have bogie but I will take it sir!

00:09:04.060 --> 00:09:05.080
You ready Wren?

00:09:05.440 --> 00:09:05.940
Yeah!

00:09:05.940 --> 00:09:06.460
Alright...

00:09:07.420 --> 00:09:08.620
Niko for par!

00:09:13.240 --> 00:09:13.740
(pain)

00:09:13.740 --> 00:09:15.640
OOOOOOH

00:09:17.340 --> 00:09:18.200
Oh no!

00:09:18.200 --> 00:09:19.320
I'm sorry Wren!

00:09:19.900 --> 00:09:21.700
I'm so sorry Wren!

00:09:21.700 --> 00:09:23.480
I did not block that in time...

00:09:23.480 --> 00:09:24.340
You alright man?

00:09:24.340 --> 00:09:26.720
Yeah, dude, I've got the twisting going on right now...

00:09:27.360 --> 00:09:28.600
I didn't block it in time!

00:09:28.600 --> 00:09:30.600
I saw it coming and I was like: "OH NO!"

00:09:30.600 --> 00:09:31.840
I told you I wouldn't miss

00:09:33.560 --> 00:09:35.100
I've got good news and I've got bad news...

00:09:35.100 --> 00:09:37.660
Good news is that we probably won't hit you in the nuts again

00:09:37.660 --> 00:09:39.900
The bad news is, you've got two more shots coming at you

00:09:40.540 --> 00:09:41.040
Oh!

00:09:41.040 --> 00:09:41.540
Ah

00:09:41.540 --> 00:09:42.040
Deh!

00:09:42.780 --> 00:09:43.460
God, that stings!

00:09:43.820 --> 00:09:44.320
Sorry dude

00:09:46.100 --> 00:09:46.600
Oh!

00:09:47.100 --> 00:09:48.180
Right on the tailbone!

00:09:48.680 --> 00:09:49.820
Good game chaps!

00:09:50.340 --> 00:09:51.480
Well, Niko

00:09:51.920 --> 00:09:53.080
congratulations

00:09:53.080 --> 00:09:53.820
you won the game...

00:09:54.040 --> 00:09:55.300
but you still owe me ten dollars

00:09:55.300 --> 00:09:55.940
Brett,

00:09:55.940 --> 00:09:56.500
Yeah?

00:09:56.500 --> 00:09:58.500
We'll practice up and try this again

00:09:58.500 --> 00:09:59.000
Sounds good.

00:09:59.000 --> 00:10:01.000
Wren, thank you for being a great sport!

00:10:01.000 --> 00:10:02.620
And uh, you make a great target!

00:10:02.780 --> 00:10:04.620
Let's go stand back in the field...

00:10:04.620 --> 00:10:06.380
and Wren gets one shot at each one of us

00:10:06.380 --> 00:10:07.240
to try to hit us once

00:10:08.020 --> 00:10:08.760
Really!?

00:10:09.700 --> 00:10:11.500
Considering there's only one helmet and there's three of us,

00:10:11.500 --> 00:10:12.220
I'm feeling pretty good!

00:10:17.620 --> 00:10:20.160
Wren if you're gonna aim for me you're gonna have to aim a little better!

00:10:23.240 --> 00:10:23.860
Telling you right now!

00:10:24.040 --> 00:10:25.100
Aaaah!

00:10:25.500 --> 00:10:26.940
Woah!

00:10:27.640 --> 00:10:30.600
This also must've been what it was like going into battle...

00:10:30.760 --> 00:10:31.260
*thump*

00:10:31.260 --> 00:10:32.960
OOOOOH!

00:10:34.240 --> 00:10:35.000
Whoo!

00:10:35.260 --> 00:10:36.540
I definitely feel bad for Wren...

00:10:36.540 --> 00:10:38.100
It sucks being shot at with arrows,

00:10:38.100 --> 00:10:41.420
and also for all of our ancestors who got shot at in days of yore

00:10:41.980 --> 00:10:44.580
Yeah this video is dedicated to those guys that got killed with arrows

00:10:44.840 --> 00:10:45.340
For real!

